  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1002.16 Confidentiality of Certain Information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1002.16 Confidentiality of Certain Information. The price at which each owner of grant property or match property will sell the property provided pursuant to Env-Dw 1002.10(n) or Env-Dw 1002.14(e) and information regarding financial encumbrances such as mortgages or liens that is submitted in accordance with Env-Dw 1002.10(h) or Env-Dw 1002.14(e), shall be:\n\n(a) Treated as confidential under RSA 91-A:5, IV; and\n\n(b) Subject to disclosure only with the consent of the applicant until the department has selected the application for grant funding.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 1002) #9490, eff 6-23-09; ss by #12441, eff 1-1-18 (formerly Env-Dw 1002.11)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1000.html"
